// "D - D U - U D U" in 16ths, twice a bar: the up-strums on "a" ring over beats 2 and 4.
// Bars 1 and 3 push: their last up-strum is already the next chord and rings over beat 1 (tied).
\title "Syncopated 16ths with a push"
\tempo 80
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
